{"4653750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Brave Few", "steam_appid": 4653750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Few</strong> is a World War II combined-arms combat game.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a deliberate alternative to free-to-play vehicular combat. There are no premium vehicles. No insane grind. No pay-to-win or battle pass. Ever.<br><br>The game is currently in Alpha development. Early Access release planned for this Fall.<br><br><strong>Planned for Early Access:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player campaign: The Battle of Britain as pilot and bomber gunner roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op multiplayer: PvE Bomber Crew operations (Pilot, Bomber, Gunner roles)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(stretch PvP &amp; PvE dogfights)</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Available Vehicles:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allies: Spitfire MKI &amp; MKII | B-17 (Pilot, bomber, gunners) | (stretch Spitfire MKV, P-51D)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axis: BF-109E | HE111 | (stretch JU-87 Stuka &amp; BF-110)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The campaign will focus on the Battle of Britain, inspired by operational records during the conflict. Co-op multiplayer will include small Operations that you can pilot, gun, or bomb in with your friends. <br><br>The vision is to include all planes, ground vehicles, and emplacements that were operational during WWII as the game develops. Future campaigns are planned to include historically authentic experiences across all major operations of the war.<br><br>Consistent progress updates available on the social media channels linked. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Few</strong> is a World War II combined-arms combat game.<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a deliberate alternative to free-to-play vehicular combat. There are no premium vehicles. No insane grind. No pay-to-win or battle pass. Ever.<br><br>The game is currently in Alpha development. Early Access release planned for this Fall.<br><br><strong>Planned for Early Access:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player campaign: The Battle of Britain as pilot and bomber gunner roles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op multiplayer: PvE Bomber Crew operations (Pilot, Bomber, Gunner roles)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(stretch PvP &amp; PvE dogfights)</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Available Vehicles:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allies: Spitfire MKI &amp; MKII | B-17 (Pilot, bomber, gunners) | (stretch Spitfire MKV, P-51D)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axis: BF-109E | HE111 | (stretch JU-87 Stuka &amp; BF-110)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The campaign will focus on the Battle of Britain, inspired by operational records during the conflict. Co-op multiplayer will include small Operations that you can pilot, gun, or bomb in with your friends. <br><br>The vision is to include all planes, ground vehicles, and emplacements that were operational during WWII as the game develops. Future campaigns are planned to include historically authentic experiences across all major operations of the war.<br><br>Consistent progress updates available on the social media channels linked. </p>", "short_description": "A WW2 combined arms simulator where you fly, drive, and sail authentic vehicles across multiple theaters of the war. No grind, no paywalls — just one fair price and depth-first combat across air, land, and sea.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4653750/10274aedc3e